Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.42,0:00:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad（1000，1000）\fs38\b1\bord0\shad1\fn迷你霹雳体\pos（192，45）\c&H0189DA&}勇敢者游戏2
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.79,0:00:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\fscy120\fs18\pos（192，202）\fad（1000，500）\c&H0268DA&\b1}再 战 巅 峰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.84,0:01:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,割爱如此美景去见你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leaving this to come see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.39,0:01:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经迫不及待\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}割爱如此美景去见你们\N我已经迫不及待
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.58,0:01:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}玛莎：太激动了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.71,0:01:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}纽约大学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,出租车 这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi! Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}学生会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:01:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉 非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.94,0:02:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弗里奇\N周六去诺拉餐厅吃早午餐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.38,0:02:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉尔平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gilpin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在弄牙膏货架呢 你在玩手机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still on the toothpaste? Are you on your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.09,0:02:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…我今晚回家过节 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just… I'm going home for the holidays tonight, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.42,0:02:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得现在已经是晚上了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it look like tonight to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看现在好像还是白天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because to me, it looks like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.39,0:02:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赶紧把牙膏摆好 - 好的 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Finish the toothpaste. - Okay. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.08,0:02:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad（500，500）}{\fn微软雅黑\fs16\bord1\shad0\i1\3c&H2F2F2F&}It's The Most Wonderful Time Of The Year - Andy Williams
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad（300，300）\fn微软雅黑\fs15\bord1\3c&H2F2F2F&\i1}♪ There'll be much mistltoeing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad（300，300）\fn微软雅黑\fs15\bord1\3c&H2F2F2F&\i1}♪ And hearts will be glowing ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.96,0:02:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad（300，300）\fn微软雅黑\fs15\bord1\3c&H2F2F2F&\i1}♪ When loved ones are near ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:03:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad（300，300）\fn微软雅黑\fs15\bord1\3c&H2F2F2F&\i1}♪ It's the most wonderful time ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad（300，300）\fn微软雅黑\fs15\bord1\3c&H2F2F2F&\i1}♪ It's the most wonderful time ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.73,0:03:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad（300，300）\fn微软雅黑\fs15\bord1\3c&H2F2F2F&\i1}♪ Of the year ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, we're home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在厨房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jan, Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在厨房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.35,0:04:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 你怎么在爬梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, are you on a ladder?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.85,0:04:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸 你在干什么 - 外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, What are you doing? - Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看着我像在干嘛呢 - 下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's it look like? - Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.73,0:04:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在给你们换灯泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm changing your light bulb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.89,0:04:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才出去十分钟 你就爬上梯子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I leave for 10 minutes, you're climbing ladders?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我觉得你不该爬梯子 - 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't think you should be doing that. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我连灯泡都换不了了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I can't change a light bulb?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.57,0:04:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扶我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.57,0:04:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以 我没事 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got it. I'm fine. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kiddo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.08,0:04:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how's New York City?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.87,0:04:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特别棒 - 学校呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's great. - How's school?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.41,0:04:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还行 你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好得很 我都不知道自己为啥要来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm terrific. I don't even know what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.38,0:04:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是髋关节手术做完正在恢复吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're recovering from hip surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.09,0:04:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很快就会离开这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meh! I'll be out of here in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.55,0:04:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里又不是监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.97,0:04:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想回我的公寓 就那么糟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna get back to my apartment. Is that so terrible?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的公寓吗 确实糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your apartment? Yes, it's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是不是挺冷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it really cold in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.31,0:04:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼下的暖气不好使了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The downstairs heater isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.35,0:04:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 维修人员早上来 - 简直他妈像冰窟一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The guy's coming in the morning. - It's like a goddamn icebox.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底给麦洛打电话了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever call Milo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.23,0:04:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.40,0:04:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 他打了五次电话找你 你就不能回个电话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad. He's called you five times. Would you just call him back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会给他回电的 因为我不想跟他讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not calling him back. 'Cause I don't wanna talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.11,0:05:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我帮你收拾行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I'll help you with your bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.91,0:05:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你住在这个房间啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're staying in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.04,0:05:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是室友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're roommates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我可以去楼下睡沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I could just stay downstairs on the couch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.71,0:05:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 别乱说了 - 如果你想的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? Don't be ridiculous. - If you want, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,几周就好了 会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a couple weeks. It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. Make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.34,0:05:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 别告诉你妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Don't tell your mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个插那里 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This goes there. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个插那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 试试看 好了 我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's try it. Okay, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}玛莎\N我参加\N-=2019年12月13号消息=-\N弗里奇\N斯宾塞 你在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.27,0:05:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边插那个 这边插这个 这插这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so there's that. There's this. There's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝灯 红灯 绿灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blue light, the red, the green light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}到时候见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你们俩 太可爱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at you two. How sweet is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天在你们两个起来前我就得去上班了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I have to leave for work probably before either of you gets up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.21,0:05:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过修暖气的人早上会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the heater guy's coming in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.00,0:05:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我十点要跟朋友碰头去吃早午餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna meet my friends for brunch at 10:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那棒极了 你们要去哪里吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll be nice. Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:06:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 诺拉餐厅 - 为什么要去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nora's. - What are you going there for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,布兰特福德那么多好餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the restaurants in Brantford,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.47,0:06:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你非得去他们家 - 不是我选的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you gotta go to that one? - I didn't pick it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.26,0:06:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸 有什么区别呢 都好多年了好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, what difference does it make? It's been years, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.47,0:06:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 亲爱的 你回来我真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, honey. I'm so glad you're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.60,0:06:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you too, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.15,0:06:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,变老太不爽了 别听别人胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting old sucks. Don't let anybody tell you any different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还谈着那个小女朋友吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still got that little girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.91,0:06:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.03,0:06:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not together anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想谈了还是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it her or you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很复杂 - 说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's complicated. - Try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看我能不能听明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see if I can understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最初在一起时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, when we first got together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.34,0:06:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.18,0:06:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,都跟现在的自己很不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}sort of different people than we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年一年…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, last year was…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我高三快毕业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a senior in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.73,0:06:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我终于弄明白自己是个什么样的人了 之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, I finally figured out who I was or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.24,0:07:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望自己能再次感受那种感觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could just feel like that again, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,异地恋太难了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long-distance relationships are hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.75,0:07:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道大家都这么说 但确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know everybody says that, but turns out it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.21,0:07:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能给你点小建议吗 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I give you a little advice? Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.30,0:07:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,在纽约市 每一天的每一趟地铁上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single day on every single subway car,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有很多的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's lots of ladies in New York City.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.97,0:07:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们中的五分之一 我二话不说就愿意娶进门\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one in five of them, I would marry, no questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.77,0:07:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你生命中最好的年华\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best time of your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It is? - Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.90,0:07:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以打起精神 不会比现在更好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So pull it together! It doesn't get any better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起就是下坡路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all downhill from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.87,0:08:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷夫史东\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.90,0:09:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}勇敢岛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.33,0:09:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}诺拉餐厅 24小时营业
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gosh, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 你看上去很棒 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, you look amazing. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.94,0:09:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗里奇 - 弗里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fridge. - Fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.65,0:09:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个月都在搭建房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we were building houses for two months,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.48,0:09:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家路上 在哥斯达黎加稍作停留\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then on the way home, we stopped in Costa Rica,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.40,0:09:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里也非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}which was also amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 我为你高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so awesome. I am so happy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.16,0:09:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.78,0:09:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们现在得叫你M了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, "M, " that's what we're supposed to call you now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.91,0:10:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必 只是个昵称\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to. It's just a nickname.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个大学同学给我起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of my college friends gave me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不想的话你不用那样叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to call me that if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.42,0:10:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,M 我喜欢 很性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}M. I love it. It's so hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 但你和斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - But you and Spencer,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们还没… - 对 不是 我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you're still not…? - Yeah. No. Um, we're…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.01,0:10:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是分手状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still, like, taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.35,0:10:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.45,0:10:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eh, Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.58,0:10:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want, Milo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice to see you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意进来喝杯咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'd love to come in for a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:51.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.35,0:10:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你介意我做点煎蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind if I make some eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.18,0:11:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你想做什么 我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do whatever you want. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点就行 我没一整天时间等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hurry up. I don't have all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.18,0:11:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have, um…?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常跟斯宾塞联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you been in touch with Spencer much?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.66,0:11:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 不常联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常给他发消息 但他不总是回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I text him a lot, but he doesn't always text me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.87,0:11:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know. - It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.08,0:11:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最近真是要疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been crazed lately with,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,忙于上课和练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, classes and practices,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,周末还有比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I got games on the weekends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.63,0:11:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 理解 完全理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Totally. Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是…我有点…我有点担心他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just… I've been… I've been a little worried about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.72,0:11:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他怎么…他怎么还没来 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, where…? Where is this guy? For real.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.27,0:11:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还满意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.31,0:11:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呵呵 - 你「呵呵」是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meh. - What do you mean, "Meh"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.03,0:11:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 你到底想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meh! What do you want already?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.70,0:11:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在不停地打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been calling and calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都十五年了又突然出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show up out of the blue after 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 就是想做点煎蛋吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? 'Cause you wanna make some eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得我们最刚开业时吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember when we first opened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个小洗碗工吗 叫莫里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had that little dishwasher, Morris?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.09,0:12:15.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然记得莫里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, of course I remember Morris.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.01,0:12:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚班工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked the dinner shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.09,0:12:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周六天 多数夜晚都工作到凌晨两点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six days a week, 2 in the morning most nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洗碗工 - 小莫里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The dishwasher. - Little Morris.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.02,0:12:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不把盆里其他的厨具餐具都洗完\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't even touch those saucepans until he was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对不会去洗那些炖锅\N{\fnArial\fs30}with every single utensil in the bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.02,0:12:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他干得非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the man knew his craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,小莫里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little Morris.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.66,0:12:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个…什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, get… Wha…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get to it, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说话总是拐弯抹角\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's always the scenic route with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想要干嘛 你想道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you want, you want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.75,0:12:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不得不告诉你 我并不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hate to tell you, I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我该跟你道歉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm supposed to apologize to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:12:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,修暖气的来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, heater guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.93,0:13:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾迪外公 - 安东尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grandpa Eddie? - Anthony?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.14,0:13:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错先生 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安东尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anthony!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.43,0:13:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.31,0:13:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 - 变老太不爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you doing? - Oh, getting old sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.94,0:13:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别听别人胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let anybody tell you any different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是玛莎和宝芬妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh, this is uh, Martha and-and Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.24,0:13:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是斯宾塞的外公 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Spencer's grandfather, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎 你是那个小女朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha? You're the little girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.24,0:13:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 先生 抱歉我们打搅你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sir. Sorry to barge in on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,打搅别人的不是你们 是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not barging. He's barging.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是麦洛·沃克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 麦洛 麦洛和艾迪餐厅的那个麦洛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, Milo? Like… Like Milo and Eddie's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 - 天呐 我爸说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pleased to meet you. - Man, my dad said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们开的餐厅是全镇最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you guys had the best restaurant in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚还在那里吃饭 现在叫诺拉餐厅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just there. Well, it's called Nora's now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.43,0:13:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拉餐厅 都算不上是餐馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora's. It's barely even a restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.06,0:13:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就跟个早餐摊差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more like a breakfast place now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没跟斯宾塞在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you with Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 其实我们也是来找他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we came here looking for him, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.36,0:13:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们饿吗 煎锅里有鸡蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all hungry? Eggs on the griddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:13:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想是得看看 - 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Might have to take a look at that. - Hey, man,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.32,0:14:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不光可以看\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can do more than take a look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.69,0:14:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. My man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.16,0:14:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你需要帮忙吗 - 我看起来需要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you need a hand? - Do I look like I need a hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听到了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you hear that? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是暖气 暖气坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably the heater. It's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西怎么在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it even get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.12,0:14:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.71,0:14:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道 也许是他回去找回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, maybe he went back for it or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是想修好它吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he trying to fix it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.26,0:15:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会有人想修这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would anyone try to fix that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.97,0:15:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.72,0:15:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道 也许他是去买零件了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe he went to buy parts or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这样 我再给他打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look, I'm calling him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.77,0:15:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure everything's… fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四条未读短信和四个未接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fourteen texts and four missed calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他没有出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.17,0:15:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,又进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he went back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.76,0:15:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No, no, no, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 不 为什么 - 拜托 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? No. Why…? - Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.77,0:15:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他为什么要这么做 - 还记得里面什么样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why would he do that? - Remember what it was like?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:15:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我被一头河马吃了 - 我被一块蛋糕害死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got eaten by a fricking hippo! - I got killed by a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.81,0:16:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is he gonna get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须要拿到 绿宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gotta take the… The green jewel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.16,0:16:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞回到雕像里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stick it back in the statue thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.91,0:16:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,只靠他自己吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.01,0:16:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起去 - 你们是疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm coming with you. - Are you out of your minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.64,0:16:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以的 我们去过 知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do this. We've been there. We know what to expect.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的不能再跟白人一起玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta stop hanging out with white people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道自己是什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.81,0:16:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 我们玩过而且赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. We played before and we won.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们差点就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.07,0:16:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道换做是你 他肯定会救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he would do it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.11,0:16:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,也会救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}For any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 看起来很破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. It looks pretty busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到勇敢岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.59,0:17:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 我们还没选角色呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What…? We haven't even picked our guys yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.80,0:17:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了 开始了 最讨厌这个部分了 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Here we go. Oh, I hate this part. All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.03,0:17:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I…?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it…? I can't believe…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.23,0:18:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.60,0:18:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.11,0:18:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.57,0:18:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.87,0:18:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in tarnation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.25,0:18:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 我是麦洛·沃克 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell are you? - I'm Milo Walker. Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:38.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.35,0:18:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth? What…?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the…? - Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.02,0:18:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.23,0:18:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会吧 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This isn't happening. - Pardon me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 你是斯宾塞的外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - You're Spencer's grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.32,0:18:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然了 - 你是麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, no kidding. - And you are Milo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.66,0:18:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I certainly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是玛莎 斯宾塞的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Martha, Spencer's…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.41,0:19:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是他那个小女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the little girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look out! - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.75,0:19:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.58,0:19:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是他妈疼死我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt like a goddamn…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.59,0:19:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝芬妮是你吗 - 什么 我不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bethany? - What? I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.59,0:19:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.55,0:19:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, no, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.26,0:19:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.60,0:19:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.35,0:19:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是弗里奇 该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm Fridge, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧好吧 有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay, something went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.94,0:19:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. If I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你 斯宾塞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you…? Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么都叫我斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does everybody keep calling me Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是艾迪外公 那是…麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that is Grandpa Eddie. And that, heh… is Milo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pleased to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.05,0:19:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那宝芬妮呢 斯宾塞呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where's Bethany? And where's Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.97,0:19:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know! Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.72,0:20:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏 它没让我们选角色 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}The game, it didn't let us pick our avatars, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为它坏了 - 是的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because it's busted! - Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.02,0:20:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我也在思考这个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I was just wondering the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.35,0:20:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是死了然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I die and turn into.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了一个矮个肌肉童子军吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}some kind of a small, muscular Boy Scout?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.65,0:20:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们没死 - 那这到底是什么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not dead. - So then what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这听起来可能会很怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this is gonna sound very, uh, strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.07,0:20:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我们在一个叫做勇敢岛的电游里\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we are in a video game called Jumanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.37,0:20:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们是在游戏角色的身体里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are in the bodies of video game characters, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和弗里奇 我们以前来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've been here before, Fridge and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.83,0:20:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上一次 我是你这个角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time, I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.17,0:20:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在游戏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a game!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.59,0:20:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到斯宾塞 他也在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta find Spencer 'cause he's in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯宾塞 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spencer? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.22,0:20:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在这里吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's here? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.01,0:20:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪的外孙 斯宾塞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer, Eddie's grandson?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.81,0:20:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也在这里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里 我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here, and we gotta find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在我们算是在躲猫猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's like a hide-and-go-seek situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不当鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not "it."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的髋关节现在感觉良好\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hip feels pretty good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的关节简直像奶油一样顺滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my joints feel like butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.54,0:21:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, look at those.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.04,0:21:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧 看看我这身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at these. Look at what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.46,0:21:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有麻烦了 - 你才发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, we have some issues here. - You're telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.84,0:21:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成了那个老胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the old fat dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.59,0:21:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次回来我居然更倒霉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came back, and things actually got worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少上次我还是黑人\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least last time I was still black.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.85,0:21:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个小可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at this little fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克先生 别离水太近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Walker, don't get too close to the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.89,0:21:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 躲开 - 抱歉 你刚才说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get away from there! - I'm sorry, what'd you say now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.28,0:21:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.87,0:21:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.83,0:21:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一头河马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that there was a hippopotamus.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.55,0:21:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的速度很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they are awfully fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.34,0:22:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比马还快 难以置信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster than a horse, if you can believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.05,0:22:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且咬合力也十分可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they've got an awful ferocious bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.93,0:22:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害 有趣的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about that? You know, the funny thing is,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.60,0:22:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到现在才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己知道这么多关于河马的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}knowing much about hippos until right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个动物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a zoologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.19,0:22:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 什么 - 我们是在佛罗里达州吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, what now? - Are we in Florida?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.90,0:22:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这是个很危险的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just listen. This is a dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.82,0:22:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.16,0:22:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我和玛莎 我们来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Martha and I, we've been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道该做什么 你们一定要时刻小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know what we're doing. You gotta stay alert all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.58,0:22:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果靠近水边 就要提防水里的东西 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'm near water, I got one eye on the water, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.79,0:22:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连脑袋后面都要长双眼睛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to have eyes in the back of your…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:43.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.01,0:22:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这老天的到底是发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What in the Sam Hill just happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.23,0:22:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.19,0:22:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:22:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.15,0:23:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么有飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.24,0:23:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么情况 - 快 跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Come on! Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 走了 跟我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. Let's go. Follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.69,0:23:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到勇敢岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.69,0:23:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他为什么在飞机里 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why is he in a plane? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.99,0:23:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别站着了 快上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't just stand there. Hop in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带 没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strap in. There's no time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷夫史东博士 著名考古学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Bravestone, famed archeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.38,0:23:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,国际探险家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and international explorer,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.05,0:23:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在急切地等你到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been so anxious for your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.79,0:23:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是在跟我说话吗 - 是的他在和你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You talking to me? - Yes he is talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.41,0:23:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛再一次陷入了危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, Jumanji is in great peril,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.64,0:23:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你能拯救它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and only you can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.27,0:23:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 我们是来找我们的朋友的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nigel, we're looking for our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.69,0:23:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有见到 任何人都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you seen, like, anyone…?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.74,0:23:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,露比·朗德霍斯 男人杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby Roundhouse, killer of men,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.97,0:23:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到勇敢岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:24:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「男人杀手」 - 是的 我…专门杀男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Killer of men"? - Yeah, I, uh… I kill guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.83,0:24:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so glad you've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.43,0:24:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在急切地等你到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been so anxious for your arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.72,0:24:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这人怎么回事 - 我亲爱的小老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's with this fella? - My dearest Mouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.25,0:24:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定记得我\N{\fnArial\fs30}surely you remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.72,0:24:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奈杰尔·比林斯利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nigel Billingsly at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.63,0:24:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 我就知道是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Nigel, I thought that was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.53,0:24:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是…那叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a… Uh, what is it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- NPC 非玩家角色 - 他不是真人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- NPC, a non-player character. - He's not a real person.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.17,0:24:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会说的话只有那么几句\N{\fnArial\fs30}He only has a limited number of things he can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.72,0:24:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友卡尔就那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend Carl is just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.83,0:24:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈杰尔 我们在找人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nigel, we're looking for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.24,0:24:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他人来勇敢岛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has anyone else arrived in Jumanji…?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.75,0:24:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛陷入了危机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumanji is in great peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你的信里有详细说明 布雷夫史东博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all detailed in the letter I sent you, Dr. Bravestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.55,0:24:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该读出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.75,0:24:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.33,0:24:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有信吗 - 我有信吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have a letter? - Do I have a letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.86,0:24:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看看你的口袋 - 我为什么会有封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check your pockets. - Why would I have a letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.88,0:24:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这位奈杰尔 他给你写了封信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Nigel here he… he wrote you a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.92,0:24:44.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没收到这人的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get a letter from this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.58,0:24:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们是在电子游戏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we are in a video game, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.16,0:24:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在电子游戏里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a video game?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.77,0:24:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.77,0:24:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们确实死过了 - 我们在地狱吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We did die. - Are we in hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.65,0:24:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.15,0:24:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你的信里有详细说明 布雷夫史东博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's detailed in the letter I sent you, Dr. Bravestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.76,0:24:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该大声念出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.11,0:24:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有信 要我和你说多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a letter! How many times I gotta tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.85,0:25:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾迪 信就在你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, Eddie. It's in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.39,0:25:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这信是从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.98,0:25:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要注意自己手里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to pay attention to what's in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.03,0:25:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你应该大声念出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you should read it aloud.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.99,0:25:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「布雷夫史东博士 我恳切地希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dr. Bravestone, it is my solemn hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.01,0:25:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这封信能寄到你手里 因为「\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this letter finds you, for again…"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.23,0:25:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛再一次处于极度危险的境地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumanji is in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.72,0:25:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们急需你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need your help at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.85,0:25:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.79,0:25:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是过场动画 是给我们说明…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a cutscene. It's how we find out…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.36,0:25:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 之后我再解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what, I'll explain afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.63,0:25:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最可怕的噩梦已经到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, our worst nightmare has come to pass,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.96,0:25:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为野蛮人尤尔根回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Jurgen the Brutal has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.13,0:25:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 那个最邪恶的勇敢岛征服者又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, that most vicious Jumanjian conqueror is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.29,0:25:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且还带来了他的野蛮部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's brought with him his savage horde.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.21,0:25:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从扎特米尔山的堡垒下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They descended from their fortress atop Mount Zhatmire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.63,0:25:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,向南来到埃维安省\N{\fnArial\fs30}and made their way south to the Avian Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.74,0:25:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是神圣的猎鹰宝石之家\N{\fnArial\fs30}home of the sacred Falcon Jewel,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.52,0:25:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而宝石戴在村落长老的颈项之上\N{\fnArial\fs30}worn around the neck of the village elder.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.86,0:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,猎鹰是勇敢岛的孕育宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Falcon is the fertility jewel of Jumanji,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年来 埃维安省的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it has been guarded by the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.92,0:26:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直守护着宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Avian Province for hundreds of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.07,0:26:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要宝石能见到阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long as the jewel can see the sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.29,0:26:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,便能使水草丰润 土地肥沃\N{\fnArial\fs30}the waters will flow and the land will flourish.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.69,0:26:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.77,0:26:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多勇敢的人在那天死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many brave souls died that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但尤尔根得偿所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}but Jurgen got what he came for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.30,0:26:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将宝石藏于黑暗中\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stowed the jewel in darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见天日\N{\fnArial\fs30}hidden from the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.18,0:26:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,干旱降临这片大地\N{\fnArial\fs30}A drought befell the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.01,0:26:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,庄稼枯萎死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crops dried out and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.18,0:26:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不将宝石尽快归还\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if the jewel is not returned soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.41,0:26:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许将无法挽回濒死的生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}it may be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.29,0:26:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们将你和你睿智的同伴们召唤前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we called for you and your brilliant associates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.95,0:27:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白你一定犹如泰山压顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand the enormous weight that this must carry for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.68,0:27:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷夫史东博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Bravestone,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.05,0:27:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次历险与之前大不相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}how this adventure is like no other,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为杀死你父母的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}since it was Jurgen the Brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.53,0:27:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是野蛮人尤尔根\N{\fnArial\fs30}who killed your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.78,0:27:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.56,0:27:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他杀死了布雷夫史东博士的父母吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed Dr. Bravestone's parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 正是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.34,0:27:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在博士年幼之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the doctor was just a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.24,0:27:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那太糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, that's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.26,0:27:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要我说多少次 我们是在电子游戏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't say this enough: We're in a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.42,0:27:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一定要从野蛮人尤尔根手中取回宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must recover the jewel from Jurgen the Brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.87,0:27:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,让其沐浴在阳光之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and show it to the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在正往北穿越沙漠\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making his way north across the desert now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.06,0:27:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮人尤尔根 是芭芭拉的儿子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jurgen the Brutal. Is that Barbara's boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.87,0:27:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 目标是取回被掠夺的宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, the goal is to recover the loot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.51,0:27:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那个野蛮人手中将其夺回\N{\fnArial\fs30}To wrest it from the hands of the brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.52,0:27:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们希望退出游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you wish to leave the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.10,0:27:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必须拯救勇敢岛 并且大声呼喊其名\N{\fnArial\fs30}you must save Jumanji and call out its name.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.63,0:27:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 勇敢岛是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Who is Jumanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.15,0:27:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我没听错的话 是她的姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if I was listening correctly, that is her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your map.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.52,0:28:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到一片绿洲 跟着火焰找到沙漠果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find an oasis and follow the flame to the desert fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.62,0:28:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能在这里降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't land here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.57,0:28:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们得在这里跳下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you're going to have to drop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.75,0:28:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.54,0:28:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会尽量飞低一点 - 奈杰尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get as low as I can. - Nigel…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.17,0:28:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等一下 - 准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hold on. - Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean get ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.95,0:28:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有降落伞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have parachutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.26,0:28:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是应该有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we have…?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.49,0:28:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么 - 祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell? - Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.19,0:28:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛的未来就掌握在你们手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future of Jumanji is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.12,0:28:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有地方降落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did we take a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.15,0:28:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么要坐飞机 - 下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- if there's nowhere to land? - And go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.28,0:28:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.62,0:29:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.24,0:29:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,丛林呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.89,0:29:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么来这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.10,0:29:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要保持冷静 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to keep it together, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.49,0:29:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「保持冷静」 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Keep it together"? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.97,0:29:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是全新的故事线\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a whole new thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.23,0:29:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人说过我们要玩全新的故事线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody said we'd have to do a whole new thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.58,0:29:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 宝芬妮在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way, what the hell happened to Bethany?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.91,0:29:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里到底是新罕布什尔州的什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what part of New Hampshire is this exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.76,0:29:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在新罕布什尔州 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not in New Hampshire, Milo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.73,0:29:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这里不是新罕布什尔州\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. Exactly. Not New Hampshire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.83,0:29:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开始明白了吗 - 不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're starting to get it now? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.99,0:29:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不知道到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have the foggiest clue what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.70,0:29:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人一直叫我布雷夫曼医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy kept calling me Dr. Braverman,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我骨科医生的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is the name of my orthopedist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.28,0:29:52.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我是刚刚又做完一个髋关节手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking I just had another hip surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.69,0:29:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在正在从麻醉中苏醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now I'm coming out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.55,0:29:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.91,0:30:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要找到斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We have to find Spencer.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.74,0:30:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 我想我们必须得开始玩这个游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do that, I think we have to start playing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.43,0:30:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信他已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure that's what he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.87,0:30:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到他 通关游戏 然后回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find him, finish the game, and we go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.55,0:30:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.29,0:30:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.58,0:30:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重获青春了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.75,0:30:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经很久没有这么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't looked like this since…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.46,0:30:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.07,0:30:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来也没长这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You looked like this never.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.17,0:30:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.07,0:30:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我年轻时候 身材可好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was younger, I was in great shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得你年轻的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you when you were younger,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.51,0:30:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不长这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and… this is not what you looked like.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.03,0:30:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我的眼睛是另一种颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think my eyes are a different color.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.33,0:30:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从头到脚都是另一种颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you is a different color.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.95,0:30:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样子看起来还不错吧 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good look on me, huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往北走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. They're headed north.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.80,0:30:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 北是哪一边 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Which way is north? - I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.10,0:30:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不要看看地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you wanna check the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.60,0:30:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我现在变成地图通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I'm the map guy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.92,0:30:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,「找到绿洲 跟着火焰找到沙漠果实」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Find an oasis and follow the flame to the desert fruit."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.25,0:30:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着火焰找到沙漠果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the flame to the desert fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.01,0:31:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是白纸一张吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's nothing on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.41,0:31:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能看到 你看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can see it, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.94,0:31:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,地图上每个地方都是游戏中的不同关卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each place on the map is a different level of the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.71,0:31:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一步步地玩 关卡会越来越难\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the levels get harder as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.24,0:31:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}勇敢岛\N沙丘
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.68,0:31:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一关叫做\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is called…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.83,0:31:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「沙丘」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dunes."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.67,0:31:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.64,0:31:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.50,0:31:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一只鸵鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's an ostrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.92,0:31:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - Yes, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.00,0:31:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一只鸵鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is an ostrich.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.80,0:31:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸵鸟是六十种不会飞的鸟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ostrich is a flightless bird,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.86,0:31:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一种\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of 60 species.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.19,0:31:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这当中还有企鹅 鸸鹋和鹬鸵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the penguin, you got the emu, and you got the kiwi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.01,0:31:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是 我到现在才知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny thing is, I don't remember knowing…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.13,0:31:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个动物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a zoologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.49,0:31:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我是动物学家 是重要的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a zoologist last time. It's an important job.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.11,0:31:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,能快点说完鸵鸟的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if we could get through this a little quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.30,0:31:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有就是鸵鸟跑起来时速能达到72公里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, another thing is, they can run up to 45 miles per hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.37,0:31:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这让它们成为了世界上最快的两腿动物\N{\fnArial\fs30}which makes them the world's fastest two-legged animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.38,0:32:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道这些吗 太有意思了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know that? Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.69,0:32:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么神奇的生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a magnificent creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.20,0:32:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.00,0:32:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还知道别的什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.28,0:32:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个有趣的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's another interesting fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.77,0:32:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸵鸟有三个胃 厉害吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have three stomachs. How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.25,0:32:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠这么近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.55,0:32:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是只鸟罢了 快点走开 给我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a bird, okay? Come on, get moving. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.76,0:32:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么别的我们需要知道的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else we need to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.26,0:32:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 笨鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat it, bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.29,0:32:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸵鸟还有一个有趣的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another interesting thing about the ostrich…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.82,0:32:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说快滚 笨鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said scram, you stupid bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.96,0:32:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是受到威胁时 - 给我走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …is when threatened… - Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.08,0:32:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会发起攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.28,0:32:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.95,0:32:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie! Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.28,0:32:47.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪呢 他死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Eddie? Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.49,0:32:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.21,0:32:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他死了 但是他没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he died, but he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.97,0:32:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚刚害死了艾迪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I just kill Eddie…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.08,0:32:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我说话太慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}by talking too slow…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.52,0:32:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直都说我会害死他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like he always said I would?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.29,0:33:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么老是有人从天上掉下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does everybody keep dropping from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.25,0:33:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,护士 我立刻要见布雷夫曼医生 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nurse, I'm gonna need to see Dr. Braverman right now, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.70,0:33:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是你的护士 大家听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your nurse. Okay, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.40,0:33:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们手臂上的纹身 表示我们的生命数\N{\fnArial\fs30}These tattoos on our arms, that is your life count.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.26,0:33:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们每人有三条命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We each have three lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.93,0:33:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和弗里奇每人只剩两条了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and Fridge each have two left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.46,0:33:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果三条都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you lose all three,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.00,0:33:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 游戏就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}listen to me, it is game over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.87,0:33:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩完了 你们就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.72,0:33:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,死翘翘的死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead like… "Kaputski"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.50,0:33:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.76,0:33:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,死翘翘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kaputski.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.15,0:33:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.29,0:33:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这下可不妙 - 你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not good. - Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.72,0:34:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于鸵鸟还有一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's one more thing about ostriches.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.06,0:34:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.17,0:34:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.41,0:34:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们总是成群结队\N{\fnArial\fs30}They travel in herds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.82,0:34:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.51,0:34:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快上沙滩汽车 - 快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dune buggies, let's go! - Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.45,0:34:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赶快 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shake a leg! - Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.59,0:34:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我这么慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I so slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.89,0:34:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haul ass, girl. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.08,0:34:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 我来了 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on! - I'm coming, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.07,0:34:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 你看到哪里有钥匙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go. - Do you see the key anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.94,0:34:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这要怎么开 - 我没开过这种车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, how do I do this? - I've never driven one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.87,0:34:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在仪表盘下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe under the dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.84,0:34:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 绿色按钮 - 绿色按钮 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Green button! - Green button. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.75,0:34:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.59,0:34:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.11,0:34:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.24,0:35:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.76,0:35:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开车技术太烂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a terrible driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.07,0:35:07.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 我们这不挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? We're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.67,0:35:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁好了 你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody fine. You…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.49,0:35:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Ahh, ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.95,0:35:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, help! Oh, oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.29,0:35:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓牢了 艾迪 求你别松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on, Eddie. Please don't let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.26,0:35:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, help. Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.08,0:35:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help. Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.25,0:35:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.31,0:35:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.91,0:35:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该甩掉它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.95,0:35:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.15,0:36:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.73,0:36:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.62,0:36:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办 怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do? What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.44,0:36:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.94,0:36:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.23,0:36:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suckers!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.47,0:36:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.78,0:36:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.37,0:36:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哥们 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, dude! - Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.83,0:36:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.89,0:36:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.46,0:37:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.70,0:37:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鸟 鸟 鸟 鸟 鸟 - 鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Birds, birds, birds, birds, birds! - Birds!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.28,0:37:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞什么鬼 老兄 - 它们是不会飞的鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell, man? - They're flightless birds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.59,0:37:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是一辆不会飞的沙地车\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a flightless dune buggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.06,0:37:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.06,0:37:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们过不去的 - 我们能过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're not going to make it. - We're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.00,0:37:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 过不去 - 我觉得我们过不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, we're not! - I don't think we're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.98,0:37:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.81,0:37:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.95,0:37:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,太酷炫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.08,0:37:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这司机糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, horrible driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.41,0:37:59.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到了吗 蠢鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you see that, birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.11,0:38:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,别招惹小年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't mess with the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.24,0:38:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那么棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.29,0:38:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.03,0:38:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太优秀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.59,0:38:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我救了你 我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I saved you, I saved you,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.22,0:38:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还一边开车一边从鸟嘴里救了这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved this guy from a bird while I was driving a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.71,0:38:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个没有感情的战斗机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a machine. I was relentless.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.85,0:38:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我无所畏惧 - 是的 没错 无所畏惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was fearless. - Yes. Exactly. Fearless.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.13,0:38:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是布雷夫史东 看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Bravestone. Okay, check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.07,0:38:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.79,0:38:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N弹簧刀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.60,0:38:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.44,0:38:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的强项和弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your strengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.98,0:38:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你的游戏角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I mean your avatar,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.42,0:38:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,布拉维斯顿博士的强项和弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Bravestone's, strengths and weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.88,0:38:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「无畏」 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fearless, " Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.59,0:38:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N弹簧刀
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.72,0:38:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「速度 攀爬」 - 「回旋镖」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Speed. Climbing." - "Boomerang"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.44,0:38:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「闷骚专注」是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Smoldering intensity"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.19,0:38:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的一个傻傻的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this stupid face you make.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.57,0:38:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.80,0:38:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个老家伙 别发花痴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old man. Get it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.67,0:39:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 你没事吧 你心脏病发作了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, you okay? You having a heart attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.95,0:39:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他左侧身体都不能动了 艾迪 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}His whole left side is shutting down. Eddie, look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.19,0:39:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么 - 好了 你恢复正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah? - There you go. Now you're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.09,0:39:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱点 「弹簧刀」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weakness: "switchblade."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.62,0:39:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N弹簧刀
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.54,0:39:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹簧刀 这个是新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switchblade? Hey, that's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.82,0:39:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷夫史东上次没有弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravestone didn't have weaknesses last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.54,0:39:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 非常让我抓狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, bugged the hell out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.63,0:39:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想我是不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.34,0:39:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N毒液
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.37,0:39:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N毒液
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.13,0:39:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「双截棍」 这个是新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nunchucks"? That's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.56,0:39:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 这些强项太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn, that's a good list.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛 拍一下左边 大概胸口位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo, push on your left, like, chest area.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.97,0:39:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对不起 什么 - 快点 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, what? - Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.48,0:39:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N蛋糕\N速度\N力量
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.35,0:39:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有一个 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got one too. What…?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.56,0:39:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 「动物学」 就是你刚才说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My."Zoology." That's what you were talking about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.20,0:39:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 没错 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. Exactly. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的游戏角色是个动物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your avatar is a zoologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.06,0:39:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的侄子麦克斯韦是兽医\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, my nephew Maxwell is a veterinarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.95,0:39:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多么迷人… - 「语言学」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What a fascinating… - "Linguistics"?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.49,0:39:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}强项\N生物学\N武器专员\N语言学
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.36,0:39:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我上次没有这个 - 研究语言\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I didn't have that last time. - The study of languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.12,0:39:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,也说得通 他把语言研究了个透\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense. He studies the entire language.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.69,0:39:57.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,也说不到点子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his way to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.36,0:40:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 他是32岁 还是35岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, he's 32. Or is he 35?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.76,0:40:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光飞逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time does fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.89,0:40:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们快点结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's get it over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.18,0:40:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N耐力\N高温\N阳光\N沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.96,0:40:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.62,0:40:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,几何学是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, geometry is…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.10,0:40:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 新的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is new. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.56,0:40:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁不想更加擅长几何呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wouldn't wanna be better at geometry?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.79,0:40:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,弱点是 「耐力」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for weaknesses, "Endurance."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.20,0:40:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么 瞧瞧看 「高温 阳光和沙子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what else? Let's see, "Heat, sun and sand."
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.25,0:40:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N耐力\N高温\N阳光\N沙子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.95,0:40:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该没什么问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.26,0:40:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又不是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we're in the middle of.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.26,0:40:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的沙漠中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}a goddamn desert or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.10,0:40:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这角色的意义在哪里 谁需要这种家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point of this guy? Who even needs this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.09,0:40:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会看地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can read the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.11,0:40:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得轻巧 你会双截棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy for you to say, you got nunchucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.45,0:40:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,半年来 我每天训练四个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been training four hours a day for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.57,0:40:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在看看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.67,0:40:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 这里真热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, it is hot out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.03,0:40:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙怎么能是冒险游戏里的角色呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this guy a character in an adventure game?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.87,0:40:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.68,0:40:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得让这家伙强身健体 增强耐力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta get this guy in shape and build up some endurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.55,0:40:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.78,0:40:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,立卧撑跳 五个立卧撑跳 马上就做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burpees. Five burpees, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.65,0:40:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it going!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.95,0:41:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个了 - 一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's one. - One!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.59,0:41:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糟了 - 很好 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - Oh, yeah, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.22,0:41:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边是北边\N{\fnArial\fs30}North is that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.59,0:41:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.93,0:41:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really good to see you, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.36,0:41:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.78,0:41:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想听我说见到你很高兴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna hear that it's good to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.00,0:41:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你出卖了我 麦洛 - 我没有出卖你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sold me out, Milo. - I did not sell you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.73,0:41:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们卖掉了我们的生意 是时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sold our business. It was time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.88,0:41:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁的时候 - 是我该结束的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, time for who? - Well, it was time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.81,0:41:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 35年来每晚站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Standing on my feet,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.85,0:41:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,端上百个盘子\N{\fnArial\fs30}serving a hundred plates a night for 35 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.20,0:41:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was done.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.24,0:41:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.22,0:41:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was ready to retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.85,0:41:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm done talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.43,0:42:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「绿洲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Oasis."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.48,0:42:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该是下一个关卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's the next level.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.83,0:42:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说啥 - 游戏的下一个关卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - The next level of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.31,0:42:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在游戏里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.86,0:42:27.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 艾迪外公 我们在游戏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Yes, Grandpa Eddie, we are in a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.58,0:42:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.10,0:42:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.67,0:42:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是不想说了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.76,0:42:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝芬妮 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bethany? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.93,0:42:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也叫宝芬妮 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name's Bethany too. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.40,0:42:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 她也叫宝芬妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, her name's Bethany too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.57,0:42:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure is, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.89,0:43:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能和你谈一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.04,0:43:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 可以 进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, yeah. Uh, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.93,0:43:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.93,0:43:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道还能去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know where else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.30,0:43:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.40,0:43:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.24,0:43:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮我启动这个机器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think you can help me get the machine to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.88,0:43:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is so dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.51,0:43:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.33,0:43:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我必须试一试\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.33,0:43:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是我的队友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.02,0:43:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底要找什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what exactly are we looking for again?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.46,0:43:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找我的外孙 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for my grandson, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.54,0:43:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 「跟着火焰找沙漠果实」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, "Follow the flame to the desert fruit."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.71,0:43:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.64,0:43:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.89,0:44:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬣狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.52,0:44:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们能咬碎骨头的牙齿非比寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unusual for their bone-crushing teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.82,0:44:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}烟囱
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.18,0:44:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟囱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smoke Stack.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.10,0:44:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里有烟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's there's smoke…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.99,0:44:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里就有火\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.30,0:44:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.70,0:44:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也叫掷骰子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that a roll?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.17,0:44:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.13,0:44:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再赌两个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you two more!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.53,0:44:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,上酒 这边上酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drinks! Drinks over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.47,0:44:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边再来一轮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another round here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.52,0:44:26.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.48,0:44:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.01,0:44:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.06,0:44:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.50,0:45:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不行 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.13,0:45:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.87,0:45:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别烦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.93,0:45:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真够火辣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fiery.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.94,0:45:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是真人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a real person.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.11,0:45:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.25,0:45:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她以为我不会再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she said she thought I was never gonna come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.41,0:45:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,她想晚点再见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}she wants to get together later,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.02,0:45:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we all know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.97,0:45:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思就是她有线索告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that she's got a clue for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.04,0:45:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还真是巧 因为我也有点情况要告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a coincidence. Cause I got a clue for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.67,0:45:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有情况给她 - 稍等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a clue for her. - Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.20,0:45:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是你的前女友 她就是火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your ex-girlfriend. She's the flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.20,0:45:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「跟随火焰」 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Follow the flame." - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.50,0:45:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝石在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The jewel, it's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.59,0:46:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.09,0:46:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是杀了我父母的家伙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the guy that killed my parents?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.51,0:46:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 是 算是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Well, yeah. Kind of.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.55,0:46:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今天损失了一个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost a good man today.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.10,0:46:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之中最好的一位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The very best of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.55,0:46:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为达格芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Dagfinn…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.65,0:46:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅是我的驯鬣狗高手\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't just my hyena master.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.19,0:46:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.23,0:46:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱他如自己的兄弟一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved him like a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.49,0:46:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他离去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.66,0:46:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他深爱的鬣狗被留在世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his beloved hyenas are left…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.54,0:46:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}without their master.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.21,0:46:46.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,达格芬恩万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live Dagfinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.79,0:46:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,达格芬恩万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long live Dagfinn!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.80,0:46:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么必须要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.59,0:46:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}He died because…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他犯了个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}he made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.18,0:47:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想从我这里偷走一样很珍贵的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to steal something quite precious from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.10,0:47:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left me no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.48,0:47:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.56,0:47:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把他喂给他深爱的鬣狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feed him to his beloved hyenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.61,0:47:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太变态了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.41,0:47:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱过达格芬恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved Dagfinn!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.41,0:47:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱他超过你们中的任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's none among you I love as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.12,0:47:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.59,0:47:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.17,0:47:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.89,0:47:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.43,0:47:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住她了 我抓住小偷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got her. I got the thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.85,0:47:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.64,0:47:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们…你们是…怎么… - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you…? Are you guys…? Wha…? - Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.31,0:47:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住她 别让她跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch her! Don't let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.19,0:47:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,想偷我箱子的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to steal the key to my chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.70,0:47:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.74,0:47:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,摇摇她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shake her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.78,0:48:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 是我做的 我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I did it. It was my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.70,0:48:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.50,0:48:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just… I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.17,0:48:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我怎么…天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I was… Oy vey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.21,0:48:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…我好像换气过度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like, um… It's like I'm hyperventilating.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.93,0:48:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人有桉树精油吸入器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have, like, a eucalyptus inhaler?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.22,0:48:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者牛皮纸袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or a brown paper bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.14,0:48:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.06,0:48:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是不是挺热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it really hot in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.93,0:48:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean…?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.31,0:48:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是他 他在那 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's him. Right there. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.23,0:48:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是斯宾塞 听着 我能认出我外孙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't Spencer. Look, I know my grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.81,0:48:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我外孙是个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandson's a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.48,0:48:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是换发型了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he change his hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.15,0:48:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她的头砍了 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut off her head. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.82,0:48:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她的头砍了 - 等等 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut off her head! - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.03,0:48:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 还是别砍我的头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think, uh, maybe don't cut off my head?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.91,0:48:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.49,0:48:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天 - 他刚才是不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My. - Did he just…?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.37,0:48:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.17,0:48:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的健康提醒器响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my Life Alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.50,0:48:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得吃药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta take my pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.76,0:49:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.01,0:49:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.97,0:49:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.31,0:49:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么来这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.85,0:49:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么来了 我们来救你啊 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here? We came to get you, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.60,0:49:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝芬妮 - 不是宝芬妮 我是弗里奇 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bethany? - Not Bethany. Fridge, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.86,0:49:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? So, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.90,0:49:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是麦洛·沃克 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo Walker, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.11,0:49:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.49,0:49:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯宾塞 是你吗 孩子 - 外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spencer? Is that you, kiddo? - Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.54,0:49:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 我找到斯宾塞了 在这呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, I found Spencer. Here's Spencer right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.75,0:49:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偷东西干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you stealing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.71,0:49:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是之前的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.01,0:49:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.51,0:49:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.85,0:49:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.94,0:50:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 差点得手 我都拿到钥匙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, I was so close. I had the key in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.65,0:50:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你为什么要阻止我 - 有人说有小偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why'd you stop me? - Huh? Someone yelled "thief, "
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.11,0:50:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就抓住你了 还要我怎么做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I grabbed you. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.82,0:50:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不该来这里的 都在我掌控之中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys shouldn't have come here. I had it under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.54,0:50:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 因为你似乎刚被杀了一回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you? Because it looked like you just got murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.91,0:50:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟怎么回事 斯宾塞 你为什么来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell, Spencer? Why are you even here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.83,0:50:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏怎么会在你手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you have the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.17,0:50:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把游戏毁了 就是不愿今天这一幕发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We destroyed it so that this would never happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.75,0:50:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我返回去拿到的 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went back and got it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.92,0:50:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道为什么 但我还是拿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I don't know why I did it, but I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.05,0:50:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后昨晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then last night…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.05,0:50:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心情有点奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I've been in kind of a weird place,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.64,0:50:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就有了这种想法 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and something came over me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.35,0:50:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们又困在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we're all stuck here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.89,0:50:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我会成为他呢 布雷夫史东\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that I would be him. Bravestone!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.69,0:50:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…我想重新拥有那种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want… I wanted to feel like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.57,0:50:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种…我什么都能做到的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like… I could do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.20,0:50:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但相反 我成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But instead, I'm, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.83,0:50:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,明·迅足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ming Fleetfoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.00,0:50:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N花粉
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.50,0:50:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「飞贼 扒手 撬保险箱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Cat burglar, pickpocket, safecracker."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.63,0:50:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个角色也比我的好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another better character.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.17,0:51:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「弱势 花粉」 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Weakness: pollen." - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.38,0:51:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她身材纤细身手敏捷 还过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's small and crafty and, and has allergies.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.80,0:51:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她简直就是我本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she's basically me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.26,0:51:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓 要是我们活下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, man, if we survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.18,0:51:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.68,0:51:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法相信你是故意回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't believe you came back here on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.31,0:51:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.65,0:51:17.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.52,0:51:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.82,0:51:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.11,0:51:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁 - 我前任\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - My ex.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.99,0:51:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.45,0:51:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.07,0:51:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是让我丈夫知道我和你说了话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If my husband knew I was talking to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.99,0:51:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就活不到明天早晨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'd be dead by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.25,0:51:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就别告诉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.00,0:51:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 尤尔根和他的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, Jurgen and his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.33,0:51:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回他的堡垒去\N{\fnArial\fs30}are returning to his fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.46,0:51:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要在那里见卡巴比克兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, they will meet the Brothers Kababik.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.59,0:51:48.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会把猎鹰宝石交给他们 以此结成联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will trade the Falcon Jewel, and an alliance will be formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.34,0:51:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要在此之前拿到宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must get the jewel before that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.97,0:51:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们唯一的希望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're our only hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.64,0:51:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你必须赶紧去\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.77,0:51:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}My.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.44,0:52:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你必须要走了 - 该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now you must go. - Gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.28,0:52:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 他们会见到什么兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, they're gonna meet the Brothers who?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.11,0:52:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴比克兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brothers Kababik.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.36,0:52:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 巴巴比克兄弟 - 小点声\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The, the Brothers Bababik. - Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.74,0:52:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡巴比克 - 你必须要在此之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Kababik? - You must get the jewel.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.91,0:52:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}before that happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.49,0:52:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们唯一的希望了 所以你必须赶紧去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are our only hope, so you must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.75,0:52:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你应该再给我们解释一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should explain it to us one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.42,0:52:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.92,0:52:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那沙漠果实是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the desert fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.51,0:52:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不指引我们去找那个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you gonna lead us to that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.89,0:52:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I must go…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.51,0:52:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁弹簧刀还没发现我不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Switchblade realizes I'm gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.60,0:52:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 弹簧刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Switchblade?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.73,0:52:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.48,0:52:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 布雷夫史东博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Dr. Bravestone.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.03,0:52:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.32,0:52:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.15,0:52:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}is my curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.83,0:52:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.95,0:52:59.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她似乎是个好姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seems like a nice girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.71,0:53:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.13,0:53:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了大伙 要想追上尤尔根 我们就需要骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you guys, if we're gonna catch up with Jurgen, we need camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.43,0:53:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要找到那个什么沙漠果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need to find the desert fruit, whatever that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.76,0:53:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,「跟随火焰」 我猜我们得跟着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Follow the flame." I mean, I guess we have to follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.35,0:53:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去跟着她 我们去偷几头骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys follow her, we'll go steal some camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.58,0:54:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,「勇敢岛浆果树」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Jumanji Berry Tree."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.07,0:54:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}勇敢岛浆果树\N所需之时 勿忘种子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.53,0:54:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛浆果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumanji berry?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.49,0:54:11.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是沙漠果实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a desert fruit?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.11,0:54:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.28,0:54:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「所需之时 勿忘种子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"In the moment of need, remember the seed."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.49,0:54:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点勇敢岛智慧的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little bit of Jumanji wisdom there.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.00,0:54:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.76,0:54:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 麦洛和我进去偷骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Milo and I will break in and get the camels.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.26,0:54:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 你在这里放哨 好吗 低调点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa, you stay here on lookout, alright? Keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.31,0:54:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白吗 低调点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it? Low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.35,0:54:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有人要进牲畜棚\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone tries to enter the livery,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.06,0:54:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就吹个口哨之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}just, I don't know, whistle or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.23,0:54:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.82,0:54:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是你闷骚的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not when you smolder.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.40,0:54:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这时机不对 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not the moment for it. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.07,0:54:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就那么做了 也不知道在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did it. I don't know what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.53,0:54:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看着就像肚子不舒服一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like your stomach is upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.95,0:55:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是吃坏肚了子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you ate something bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.41,0:55:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.75,0:55:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在出汗 我在出汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sweating. I'm sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.33,0:55:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常不适应偷东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealing makes me very uncomfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.96,0:55:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个盗贼来说这可不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is not ideal for a burglar.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.44,0:55:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么果实在树上\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the fruit is in the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.66,0:55:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果不穿过这片水\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can't get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.03,0:55:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道是不是水\N{\fnArial\fs30}without going through the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.82,0:55:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,就摘不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whatever that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.74,0:55:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会被煮熟或者被食人鱼吃了之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get boiled or eaten by piranhas or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.25,0:55:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「跟随火焰」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Follow the flame."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.42,0:55:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该要这么过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that's how we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.46,0:55:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不知道自己怎么可能跳过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't know how I'm supposed to make that jump.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.68,0:55:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可行性\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's doable…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.68,0:56:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我没有平时那种爆发力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't have my usual explosiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.89,0:56:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么…靠 厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wh… Ho! Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.84,0:56:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.16,0:56:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.45,0:56:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.67,0:56:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛莎 - 果实非常重\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Martha! - Oh, it's really heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.38,0:56:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.30,0:56:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.61,0:56:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.11,0:56:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什… - 老天 什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What…? - The hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.86,0:56:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.49,0:57:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么鬼 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The hell, man? - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.12,0:57:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弗里奇 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fridge? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.37,0:57:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.25,0:57:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.63,0:57:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一边去 这里没什么好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, move along. Nothing to see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.88,0:57:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.30,0:57:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说赶紧走 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, keep walking, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.68,0:57:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没什么好看的 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to see here. Beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.43,0:57:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 我让你们走开 一边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What'd you say? - I said beat it, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.89,0:57:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.91,0:57:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.08,0:57:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想跟我打吗 来啊 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a piece of me? Yeah, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.13,0:57:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有什么能耐 让我瞧瞧 来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got? What do you got? Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.67,0:58:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来挨揍啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.18,0:58:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 你们这些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.52,0:58:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 骆驼 骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, camel, camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.27,0:58:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.56,0:58:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是骄傲雄壮的动物 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are proud and majestic animals, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.45,0:58:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.03,0:58:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你是…你刚刚是在和它们说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you, did you…? Were you just talking to them?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.04,0:58:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,按你的菜单键 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, press your menu. Uh, it's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.83,0:58:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}弱点\N蛋糕\N速度\N力量
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.35,0:58:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「语言学」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Linguistics."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.88,0:58:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以和动物对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can talk to animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.76,0:58:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.80,0:58:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来我能和骆驼对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears that I speak camel.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.18,0:58:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让它们跟我们走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you ask them to like…come with us and…?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.35,0:58:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.39,0:58:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们有话要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're willing to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.98,0:58:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们想知道对它们有什么好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they wanna know what's in it for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.89,0:58:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我们有多少行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}and how much luggage we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.90,0:58:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看我这样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you look at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.07,0:59:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,扮这么个角色能干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what am I supposed to do with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.69,0:59:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是地图通\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.28,0:59:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想做地图通 我应该是她才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna read the map. I'm supposed to be her.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.78,0:59:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果呢 我脸上都长毛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, there's actual hair growing out of my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.78,0:59:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 每具身体都很美 即便这个也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. All bodies are beautiful, even this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.29,0:59:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.09,0:59:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真神奇 - 当心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, this is amazing! - Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.22,0:59:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fridge…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.30,0:59:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个角色真是棒呆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, this thing is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.39,0:59:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 那身体不是个玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. That body is not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.18,0:59:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是玩具 这身体是一台机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.10,0:59:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,更棒的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on top of that…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.44,0:59:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有胸\N{\fnArial\fs30}boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.06,0:59:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你碰我的胸 我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Touch my boobs, and I will murder you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.03,0:59:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了 我做的第一件事就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late. It was literally the first thing I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.45,0:59:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了 别那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.24,0:59:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带着勇敢岛浆果去跟他们汇合吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's take this Jumanji berry and go meet them.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.45,0:59:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.12,0:59:56.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要试试你做的那套空中杂耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying that flying acrobat thing you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.37,0:59:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别 我们已经有浆果了 - 看好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. We have the berry. - Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.00,0:59:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.46,1:00:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.96,1:00:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里奇 小心点 我跟你说 那身体是个武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fridge, be careful! I am telling you, that body's a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.88,1:00:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道它能做到什么地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even know what it's capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.30,1:00:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.59,1:00:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那身体是把上膛的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}That body's a loaded gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.01,1:00:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这把枪现在就要射击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! And this gun's about to go off!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.56,1:00:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.27,1:00:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.06,1:00:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.56,1:00:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天 - 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.53,1:00:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 没事 我拉住你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, Okay, I got you. I got ya.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.29,1:00:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.25,1:00:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 刚刚太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, that was awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.38,1:00:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌当地图通\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate being the map guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.63,1:00:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶紧走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.10,1:00:58.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹簧刀 他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switchblade! There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.60,1:01:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷夫史东\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravestone!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.73,1:01:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 离我老婆远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you to stay the hell away from my wife!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.36,1:01:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人来了 - 你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got company. - What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.57,1:01:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了伙计们 就是现在 我们需要你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys, this is the moment. We need you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.66,1:01:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们说我们可以从后门出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they said that we can get away out the back door.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.04,1:01:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是在和那头骆驼说话吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you talking to that camel? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.04,1:01:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是露希尔和汉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Lucille and Hank.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.84,1:01:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,后面的是杰弗瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Jeffrey's in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.43,1:01:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得赶紧走了 - 出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should get going. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.35,1:01:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爷爷无缘无故打了45个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandpa beat up 45 strangers for no reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.40,1:01:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女人的丈夫想杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman's husband is trying to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.94,1:01:47.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是沙漠果实吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that the desert fruit?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.94,1:01:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是勇敢岛浆果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's a Jumanji berry,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.82,1:01:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概有九十斤重\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it weighs like 100 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.16,1:01:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我外公带着它\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandpa will carry it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.91,1:01:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.87,1:01:59.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走吧 外公 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Grandpa. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.29,1:02:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以干掉他们 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I could take them. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.46,1:02:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢 我们刚刚逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? We escaped.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.04,1:02:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说 我能干掉他们 - 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said, I could take them. - Oh, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.25,1:02:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 艾迪外公 那是弹簧刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Grandpa Eddie, that's Switchblade!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.55,1:02:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,人生中有些时候你得逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, there's a time in life when you run.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.80,1:02:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也有一些时候 比如现在 应该留…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's a time in life, like now, where you stay…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.81,1:02:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹簧刀 弹簧刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switchblade! Switchblade!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.98,1:02:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好准头 弹簧刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shot, Switchblade!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.04,1:02:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我干啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.09,1:02:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该很快就能看到扎特米尔山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should see Mount Zhatmire pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.22,1:03:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉迪斯死前曾和我一起开车旅行过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Gladys and I took a road trip before she passed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.10,1:03:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们穿过西南\N{\fnArial\fs30}We went on a ceramics tour.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.48,1:03:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行了一次陶瓷之旅\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the Southwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.44,1:03:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了我的餐厅 就为了让你能开车到处玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my restaurant so you could drive around.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.65,1:03:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赏玩陶瓷烟灰缸 - 对 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and look at ashtrays? - Yes, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.86,1:03:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,退休了就应该干这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you do when you retire.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.41,1:03:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,拓展自己的兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You explore your interests.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.66,1:03:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have interests.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.66,1:03:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这样的人不退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys like me, we don't retire!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.41,1:03:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们工作 一直工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We work, and then we keep working,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.50,1:03:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到最后 干到死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, eventually, we die.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.54,1:03:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你让我退休了 你让我退休了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you retired me. You retired me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.54,1:03:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能撑那么就都是奇迹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a wonder I lasted as long as I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.17,1:03:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你特别难以相处 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - You're a difficult man, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.09,1:03:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,人不能抛弃自己最好的朋友 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't abandon your best friend, Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.43,1:03:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去餐厅就是失去了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I lost the restaurant, I lost everything!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.85,1:03:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.06,1:03:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, I know he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.23,1:03:45.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 你是在跟我的骆驼说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Are you talking to my camel?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.99,1:03:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我是在和骆驼说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm talking to the camel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.48,1:03:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,它看得出来你特别讨人厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he can tell that you're a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.19,1:03:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的骆驼竟然站你那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}My camel's taking your side?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.86,1:03:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不是你的骆驼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's not your camel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.95,1:03:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它只是载你一程\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just giving you a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.78,1:04:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那你们俩都去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about the both of you go screw yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.99,1:04:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你刚刚说了什么 - 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did you just say? - Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.37,1:04:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我 我们现在就在这里把这事了结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me, we gonna settle this right here, right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.29,1:04:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让你瞧瞧我的厉害 - 你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll show you what I am talking about. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.09,1:04:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我够不着地 - 麦洛 你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't know where I'm going. - Milo, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.26,1:04:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on. Wait, wait. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.10,1:04:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想跟我打 你是这么想的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a piece of me, huh? That's what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.52,1:04:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想和他打的 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not want a piece of him, Milo, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.35,1:04:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你就错了 年轻人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's where you're wrong, young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.61,1:04:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我确实想揍他一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I do want a piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.82,1:04:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想狠狠揍他一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want a big piece.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.98,1:04:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, Eddie, what you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.45,1:04:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去十五年\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that for the last 15 years,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.11,1:04:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直都在练太极\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been studying tai chi.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.03,1:04:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.20,1:04:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am harnessing my chi.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.50,1:04:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我运好气了以后 就要抽你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I'm done, I'm gonna whup your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.87,1:04:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛 我跟你说这不是个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo, I am telling you, this is not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.88,1:04:57.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.51,1:05:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dude!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.14,1:05:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能再杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta stop killing everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.44,1:05:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.07,1:05:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看这就算了结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess that's settled.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.42,1:05:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,骆驼停下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The camels just stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.13,1:05:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只能到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as far as they go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.18,1:05:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们说去尤尔根的堡垒的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get to Jurgen's fortress,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.89,1:05:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要沿这条路走\N{\fnArial\fs30}they said that we can head down this path here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.10,1:05:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make a right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.35,1:05:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就会走到他的领地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we're in his territory.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.98,1:05:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们不想去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they don't wanna go there.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.93,1:05:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它们不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}because they don't want to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.52,1:05:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不想死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't wanna die either.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.90,1:06:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真是有史以来最差劲的布雷夫史东了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the worst Bravestone of all time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.73,1:06:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们得越过…这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have to get across… this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.99,1:06:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能做到 我们能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we can do this. We can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.70,1:06:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是得慢慢来 做出谨慎的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to take our time, make careful decisions.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.24,1:06:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢 这很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.95,1:06:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从那个桥开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We start on that bridge there,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.46,1:06:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后跳到那个朝右偏三十度的\N{\fnArial\fs30}then jump to that one that heads to the right at 30 degrees,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.25,1:06:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是那两个像是梯形两腰的桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then those two that look like two sides of a trapezoid…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.84,1:07:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,几何学 原来是这里要用到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geometry. That's what it's for!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.42,1:07:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这个角色也不是完全没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this character's not totally worthless.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.09,1:07:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我先走 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go first. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.98,1:07:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看 没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.73,1:07:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 - 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. What's going on? - Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.15,1:07:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.53,1:07:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.49,1:07:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.20,1:07:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, geez.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.12,1:07:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.25,1:07:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没事 我们能做到 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. We can do this. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.00,1:07:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键是找到正确时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about finding the right timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.75,1:07:43.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 来 来 - 跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on, come on. - Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.76,1:07:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.81,1:07:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 麦洛 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Milo, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.81,1:07:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老天 - 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, Lord. - Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.94,1:08:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.32,1:08:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.74,1:08:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个石头是不是… 在动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that rock… moving?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.16,1:08:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 糟了 - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.54,1:08:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now, this is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.13,1:08:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点说 是什么 - 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, what is it? - Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.42,1:08:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说啊 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit it out! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.63,1:08:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 告诉我们 - 快告诉我们 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just tell us! - Tell us! Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.76,1:08:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是山魈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are mandrills.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.06,1:08:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得跑了 跑 跑 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should go. Go, go! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.73,1:08:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一架 钝角方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}That one! Obtuse angle!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.86,1:08:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意它们脸和屁股周围独特的鲜艳色彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Note the distinctive and colorful pigment around their face and buttocks.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.87,1:08:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,山魈是所有猴子中最重的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandrills are the heaviest of all monkeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.58,1:08:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至比狒狒更重 这两种经常被弄混\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even heavier than baboons, with which they are often confused.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.59,1:09:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在走菱形\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now head for the rhombus!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.51,1:09:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.42,1:09:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菱形 菱形 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rhombus! Rhombus! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.07,1:09:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Martha!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.59,1:09:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是那架桥 你跳错了 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not that one. You're on the wrong bridge! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.83,1:09:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟它垂直那架\N{\fnArial\fs30}The perpendicular one!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.63,1:09:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.87,1:09:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.40,1:09:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.28,1:09:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.31,1:09:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞 你后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer, behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.95,1:09:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.73,1:09:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 我接着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I got you!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.48,1:09:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.04,1:10:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.01,1:10:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.54,1:10:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.29,1:10:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.96,1:10:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.65,1:10:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.08,1:10:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.66,1:10:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa! Enough!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.60,1:10:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外公 停下 - 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grandpa, stop! - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.13,1:10:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们都掉下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.62,1:11:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.05,1:11:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.00,1:11:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Trust me!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.47,1:11:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.79,1:11:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一个 跳准抛物线的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last one. Aim for the center of the parabola!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.38,1:11:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 他娘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn. Son of a…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.30,1:11:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 艾迪 - 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie? - Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.62,1:11:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 艾迪 你去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie! Eddie, where you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.34,1:12:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.36,1:12:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.26,1:12:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie! Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.92,1:12:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 拜拜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Seriously? - Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.14,1:12:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快跑 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Run! - Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.98,1:13:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.51,1:13:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.94,1:13:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 你怎么来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alex, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.15,1:13:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝芬妮觉得你们或许需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bethany thought you might need some help.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.28,1:13:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝芬妮在哪 - 就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is Bethany? - She's right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.85,1:13:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean…?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.23,1:13:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「惊讶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Oh, my God, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.58,1:13:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然是一匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, I'm a total horse.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.10,1:13:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不敢相信我们找到了你们「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe that we found you guys."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.56,1:13:50.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是宝芬妮 你怎么样 姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, that's Bethany. What's up, girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.40,1:13:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们带了厚衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We brought you some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.89,1:13:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们肯定冻坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be freezing.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.69,1:14:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这匹马也是游戏角色吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this horse is a character in the game?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.32,1:14:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他叫赛科龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Cyclone's his name.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.81,1:14:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉怎么样 - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's that feel? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.40,1:14:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,扭那一下挺严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sprained it pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.33,1:14:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们究竟从哪找的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get these clothes anyway?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.01,1:14:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我意识到我们要深入北方\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I realized how far north we were going,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.27,1:14:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就中途停下去购物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we stopped to go shopping.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.86,1:14:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也能购物吗 你怎么知道上哪去购物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can shop here? How did you know where to do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.16,1:14:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾在这里待了二十年 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was here for 20 years, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.54,1:14:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我不用再戴那顶蠢帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I got rid of that stupid hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.48,1:14:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,却又戴上这顶蠢帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I got this stupid hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.73,1:14:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很神奇 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.64,1:14:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 神奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's something.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.11,1:14:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Eddie…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.49,1:14:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时失去餐馆并没有失去一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't lose everything when you lost the restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.30,1:14:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还拥有很多 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still got a lot, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.79,1:15:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去了朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.23,1:15:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did I.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.56,1:15:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.09,1:15:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很抱歉 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry too, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.12,1:15:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很早之前就该去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have tracked you down a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.78,1:15:41.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你来我家喝咖啡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you came over for coffee.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.70,1:15:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么促使你这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you do it, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.37,1:15:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why now?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.24,1:15:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.42,1:16:02.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.89,1:16:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,多严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.80,1:16:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没剩多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have much time left.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.23,1:16:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.31,1:16:19.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得自己很幸运 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I count myself lucky, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.93,1:16:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我娶了一个非常好的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was married to a wonderful woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.03,1:16:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,活了精彩的一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to live a wonderful life.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.73,1:16:27.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,并非人人都能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not everybody can say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.56,1:16:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我想和你改善关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I wanted to make things better with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.87,1:16:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今改善了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that they are…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.49,1:16:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.57,1:16:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为此很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm happy about that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.22,1:16:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 麦洛 快来 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa, Milo. Come on, we gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.81,1:17:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The Fortress."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.36,1:17:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad0\frz341.1\fn方正静蕾简体\c&H22140E&\pos（216，102.273）}堡垒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.92,1:17:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着像最后一关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like the last level.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.61,1:17:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们爬上山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so we climb that mountain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.17,1:17:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后找办法溜进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we sneak in somehow.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.51,1:17:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 然后在卡巴比克兄弟到之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and then we steal the jewel.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.20,1:17:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走那个宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the Brothers Kababik get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.07,1:17:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后让其沐浴在阳光之下 - 好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And then show it to the sun? - Sounds like a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.88,1:17:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.65,1:17:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我好像没听出这方案里有任何计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I think I missed the "Plan" part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.04,1:17:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚那关差点害死所有人 我都无法行走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That last level almost killed us all. I can barely walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.51,1:17:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你外公揍错人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your grandpa beats the hell out of the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.51,1:17:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我们被北极熊攻击什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we get attacked by a polar bear or something,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.73,1:17:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.83,1:17:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会揍错人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna beat up the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.37,1:17:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定会揍错人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna beat up the wrong guy!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.11,1:17:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是优秀的布雷夫史东\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a good Bravestone!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.80,1:17:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太顽固 太暴躁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too stubborn and pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.51,1:17:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不停害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep getting us killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.01,1:17:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.82,1:17:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Milo…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.56,1:17:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I say this with all due respect, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.62,1:17:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是当动物学家的好人选\N{\fnArial\fs30}is not a good person to be the zoologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.45,1:17:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说话太慢 说到重点时人早死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He talks too slow, and by the time he gets to the point, you're dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.00,1:17:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说一次 无意冒犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, no offense.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.45,1:17:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}None taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.48,1:17:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let me tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.18,1:17:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为我朋友伯纳德… - 瞧见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because my friend Bernard… - You see?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.96,1:18:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一个小偷 却神经过敏不敢偷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a thief who's too neurotic to steal anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.38,1:18:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝芬妮是一匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bethany's a horse…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.68,1:18:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道 我们又一次被困这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is, we are stuck here again,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.28,1:18:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩的生命不多 我的脚踝还疼死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are running out of lives, and my ankle is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.00,1:18:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 弗里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - Fridge!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.26,1:18:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里奇 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fridge! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.76,1:18:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, you guys gotta see this!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.31,1:18:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,在浆果树旁的水就是这个样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what the water looked like at the tree.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.28,1:18:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们那时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.10,1:18:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,互换了身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switched bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.49,1:19:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,天杀的 好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn, that is cold!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.59,1:19:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 冻死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man! It's freezing!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.85,1:19:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.14,1:19:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.50,1:19:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.81,1:19:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 伙计们 你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, you guys, hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.93,1:19:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.90,1:19:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 外公 - 是我 怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grandpa? - Yeah, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.87,1:19:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.72,1:19:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真该看看你的傲人尺寸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should see the size of your…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.35,1:19:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.41,1:19:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没想到缩小会这么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thought I'd be this happy to shrink.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.69,1:20:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过那样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never seen anything quite like that before.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.88,1:20:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 能再次用语言交流真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, it's so good to be able to talk again with words.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.88,1:20:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 斯宾塞 你好啊 - 你好 宝芬妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Spencer, hi! - Hey, Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.85,1:20:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得好好叙叙旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so much catching up to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.19,1:20:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想听你在纽约的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna hear everything about New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.06,1:20:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过感觉现在这时机不太对\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it feels like maybe this isn't the perfect, like, moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.77,1:20:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 晚点再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Like, later.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.12,1:20:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.86,1:20:23.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好点了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Better? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.89,1:20:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.45,1:20:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got hair!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.91,1:20:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,四十年来头一回 我得去告诉麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time in 40 years. I gotta go tell Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.46,1:20:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去小心点 外公 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Be careful out there, Grandpa. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.90,1:20:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你脚踝怎么样 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's your ankle? - Hm?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.44,1:20:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的脚踝 - 有点痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your ankle. - It's a little sore.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.25,1:20:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对没你表现的那么痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}But definitely not as bad as you were making it seem.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.82,1:20:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这话什么意思 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that supposed to mean? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.32,1:20:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你刚刚说自己扭伤得很厉害 没那么严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you were making a big deal of it. It's not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.83,1:20:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离那匹马远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell away from that horse!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.36,1:20:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.68,1:20:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.30,1:20:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 是哪只脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, which ankle was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.94,1:21:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.29,1:21:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands off of me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.86,1:21:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我陪着你 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you, Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.07,1:21:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.27,1:21:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.77,1:21:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪和麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie and Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.42,1:21:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,被抓走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got them.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.80,1:21:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都是冰\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's ice everywhere,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.56,1:21:26.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去只有一条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's only one road in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.90,1:21:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,四处都是守卫 我不知道怎么能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's covered with guards. I don't know how we'll get in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.91,1:21:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到冰崖顶有一处地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I see a dungeon at the top of this ice wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.25,1:21:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}堡垒
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.94,1:21:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你外公肯定被关在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That must be where they're keeping your grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.27,1:21:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛很可能在反方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Milo is probably in this, like, barn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.96,1:21:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那地方看起来像个畜棚\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the way on the other side of the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.81,1:21:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们得分头行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. We gotta split up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.23,1:21:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,一队去找麦洛 另一队救出我外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}One team goes to get Milo, the other busts out my Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.07,1:21:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我们怎么进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do we get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.02,1:21:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里奇 你背包里有什么攀冰装备吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fridge, do you have any ice-climbing equipment in your backpack?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.02,1:21:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说这样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean something like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.35,1:21:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}攀冰装备
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.31,1:22:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是这样的 - 瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just like that. - See?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.68,1:22:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我是背包男\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm the backpack guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.95,1:22:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就是原因 - 是的 你真的很在行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's why. - Yeah. You're great at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.09,1:22:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.88,1:22:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莎 你愿意跟我去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martha, will you come with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.80,1:22:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.56,1:22:24.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都忘了这样的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot what this part feels like.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.25,1:22:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.24,1:22:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.62,1:22:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以的 这只小队无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do it. This team can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.11,1:22:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我最清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows that better than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.96,1:22:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 来吧 朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Come on, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.31,1:22:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.38,1:22:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来势汹汹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.83,1:22:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来势汹汹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be, be aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.55,1:22:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来势汹汹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be aggressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.99,1:22:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 来势汹汹 一起说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be, be aggressive. Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.54,1:22:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想的不是这个 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what I thought this was. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.45,1:22:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should just go.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.49,1:22:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 加油 小队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just… Go, team.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.10,1:23:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.18,1:23:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要混到他们里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try to sneak in with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.27,1:23:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿成这样我应该可以通过 你们留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think in this outfit, I might be able to pass. You guys stay here…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.08,1:23:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 那不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No way.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.70,1:23:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,时机到了 你们留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's the moment. Stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.08,1:23:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚历克斯 不 - 祝你好运 亚历克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alex, no! - Go. Good luck, Alex.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.03,1:23:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.89,1:23:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么「我们走」 宝芬妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about, "Come on"? Bethany.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.45,1:23:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝芬妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bethany!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.09,1:23:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,向右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.60,1:23:58.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们 站住别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You there. Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.16,1:23:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁 我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who, us?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.81,1:24:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是卡巴比克兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the Brothers Kababik?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.70,1:24:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们是谁 - 你们是卡巴比克兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we the who? - Are you the Brothers Kababik?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.78,1:24:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.27,1:24:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们 我们正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are them. It is we. Us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.53,1:24:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是卡达布 卡达布里克兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Brothers Cadabra… Kadabrik.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.45,1:24:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是其中一个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is one brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.67,1:24:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是另一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I am the other brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.46,1:24:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们同父异母\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… We got different mothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.54,1:24:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们 是来取约定之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we, uh… We came to get the thing that we came to get.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.16,1:24:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴比克兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers Kababik,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.65,1:24:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表野蛮人尤尔根\N{\fnArial\fs30}on behalf of Jurgen the Brutal,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.52,1:24:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你们来到扎特米尔要塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}welcome to Zhatmire Stronghold.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.20,1:24:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.76,1:24:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我一定要问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I have to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.86,1:25:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.38,1:25:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你该来看我的时候 你都不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you come visit when you were supposed to?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.88,1:25:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你第一次取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You canceled the first time,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.06,1:25:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后又打算万圣节再来 你又取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you were gonna come for Halloween. You cancel again.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.96,1:25:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我再听到你消息的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the next time I hear from you,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.38,1:25:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉我说 我们该冷静一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}you tell me we should take a break?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.94,1:25:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 我看着你在图享网上的那些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just… I saw all your pictures on Instagram,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.13,1:25:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来那么开心 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you looked like you were having so much fun, and…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.65,1:25:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很没有安全感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got really insecure or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.95,1:25:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉我不是自己认为的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I wasn't the guy I thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.27,1:25:31.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者我不是你所认为的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I wasn't the guy you thought I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.31,1:25:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样情况就更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which would be even worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.50,1:25:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞 你觉得我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer, do you think I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.76,1:25:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是每时每刻都担惊受怕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}totally terrified all the time?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.06,1:25:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去上学 然后突然之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to school, and suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.70,1:25:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子第一次 大家真的喜欢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the first time ever, people really liked me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.83,1:25:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我一直觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm always thinking that…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.98,1:25:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, like it's…
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.34,1:25:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像是别人迟早会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.46,1:25:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实的我是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}before somebody figures out who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.06,1:25:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但后来我看到了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then I see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.50,1:26:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我喜欢上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're the person who makes me feel good…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.27,1:26:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实的自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}about who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.20,1:26:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你感到害怕 不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're, like, scared and insecure,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.64,1:26:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你最需要朋友的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's when you need your people the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.39,1:26:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mr. Walker.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.58,1:26:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉那么长的脸干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the long face?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.88,1:26:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,老一辈的冷笑话 抱歉我没忍住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad joke. Sorry. Can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.22,1:26:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来救你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.25,1:27:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.98,1:27:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是障碍跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just an obstacle course.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.10,1:27:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很擅长这个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were good at those.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.31,1:27:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了 开个房去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, get a room.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.65,1:27:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 我们来把你弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa… let's get you out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.86,1:27:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.79,1:27:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来把这地方炸了 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's blow this joint, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.42,1:27:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是得找到宝石 外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have to find the jewel, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.38,1:27:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定在金库或者珍宝室之类的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be in a vault or treasure room or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.17,1:27:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这种游戏都是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's how it works in these games.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.54,1:27:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这破地方的路上经过了一个金库\N{\fnArial\fs30}I passed a vault on the way up to this dump.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.73,1:27:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个门 一米厚的钢门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Single access, 3-foot-thick steel door.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.92,1:27:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去的唯一方法是通过天花板的炉栅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only way in is through a grate in the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.55,1:28:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I got it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.34,1:28:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要踩在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay on…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.54,1:28:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,凸起的砖块上\N{\fnArial\fs30}the raised ones.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.66,1:28:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮人尤尔根正在等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jurgen the Brutal awaits.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.52,1:28:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 你们谁是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, tell me, which brother is which?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.95,1:28:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.30,1:28:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个兄弟是哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brother is which?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.76,1:28:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们谁是奥古图斯 谁是托马托利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which of you is Augustus and which is Tomatoli?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.31,1:29:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奥古图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Augustus.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.87,1:29:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是托马托利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm Tomatolik.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.32,1:29:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥古图斯·卡巴比克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Augustus Kababik.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.12,1:29:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,全勇敢岛最聪明的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cleverest man in all of Jumanji.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.88,1:29:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 正是在下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm totally that man.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.91,1:29:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 以及托马托利·卡巴比克 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And Tomatoli Kababik. - That's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.77,1:29:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,最勇敢的阉人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bravest eunuch.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.47,1:29:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等下 什么 - 你刚是说「阉人」吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait a minute, what? - Did you say, "eunuch"?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.55,1:29:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,托马托利·卡巴比克 所有人都听过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomatoli Kababik, everyone knows the tale.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.49,1:29:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伟大无私牺牲的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}of your great and generous sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.10,1:29:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你献上你的睾丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gave your testicles.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.29,1:29:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,以此拯救这土地不受洪水所害\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to save the region from the floods.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.36,1:29:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能哪里有点误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be a little confusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.74,1:29:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 所有人都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Everybody knows the story.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.59,1:29:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这弟弟还有他著名的睾丸的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about my little brother and his famous testicles.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.15,1:29:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 愿它们安息 - 愿它们安息\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wherever they may be. - Wherever they may be.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.74,1:29:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们退一步 我们先从前面说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's back up. Let's go back a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.24,1:29:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要先说清楚几件事 - 他非常勇敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's clear some stuff up. - He's super brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.66,1:29:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直是特别聪明的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been the super clever one,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.74,1:29:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他则一直是特别勇敢的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's always been super brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.91,1:29:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特别没蛋 - 别胡说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And super ball-less. - Stop saying that!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.11,1:30:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的俩蛋都好好的在这里 - 精神上还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Both of my balls are right here! - In spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.20,1:30:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在精神上仍然存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here in spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.71,1:30:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.99,1:30:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.99,1:30:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, bro?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.26,1:30:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.50,1:30:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no balls.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.83,1:30:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝箱就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.03,1:30:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 到你了 外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You're up, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.37,1:30:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁 我吗 - 对 你是飞贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who, me? - Yes. You're the cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.22,1:30:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你的角色 明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - Your character, Ming.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.37,1:30:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明 - 对 明\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ming? - Yes, Ming.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.03,1:30:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的游戏角色 她叫这名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your avatar. That's her name.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.62,1:30:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的小包里有一套开锁器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there in your satchel, you have a set of lockpicks.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.35,1:30:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,开锁器 我怎么会有开锁器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lockpicks? Why would I have lockpicks?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.18,1:30:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为明是飞贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Ming's the cat burglar.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.59,1:30:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得应该是你们哪个来干这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think one of you should do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.35,1:30:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有这技能 - 我有这技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have the skills. - I have the skills?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.14,1:30:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你 是明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not you. Ming.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.71,1:30:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哦 明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Ming.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.38,1:30:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别问明是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't ask who Ming is.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.93,1:31:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不赖 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.22,1:31:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们就只要想办法把你搞出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we just gotta figure out how to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.94,1:31:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来看下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.41,1:31:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, that's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.81,1:31:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 要吃蛋糕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome. May I offer you a piece of cake?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.55,1:31:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.32,1:31:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.31,1:31:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.35,1:32:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.02,1:32:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那个叫明的朋友没我这么好身手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see your friend Ming do that!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.24,1:32:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got an issue here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.55,1:32:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴比克兄弟 我向二位介绍野蛮人尤尔根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers Kababik, I present Jurgen the Brutal.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.10,1:32:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.69,1:33:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这历史性的一天我们见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we meet on this historic day.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.27,1:33:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 见到阁下真是万分荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is so great to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.70,1:33:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人 你那又粗又圆的脖子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Honor, if that be the Falcon Jewel.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.07,1:33:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,挂着的如果正是猎鹰宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}upon your thick and meaty neck,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.16,1:33:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们应该\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps we should…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.58,1:33:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.04,1:33:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我们建立了牢不可破的同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today we forge an unbreakable alliance.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.67,1:33:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的家族会加入我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your family will join me,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.09,1:33:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片接一片的土地 我们终会征服世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and land by land, we'll take the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.93,1:33:31.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以在这历史性的一天 我要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I ask, on this historic day,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.51,1:33:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.18,1:33:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁在哪里 - 你说的是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's who? - Who you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.27,1:33:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.15,1:33:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,即将嫁给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon to be my bride.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.28,1:33:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样 这其中可能有什么误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I think that there's been a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.24,1:33:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的妹妹在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.99,1:33:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这说的是哪个妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which sister were we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.50,1:34:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,黛比 布鲁克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Debbie or… Brooke?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.63,1:34:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是塞拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Sierra?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.09,1:34:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的妹妹在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is your sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.30,1:34:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她正在准备 就在旅店里\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's getting ready, back at the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.93,1:34:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在干新娘婚礼当天会干的那些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's doing what brides do on their wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.43,1:34:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟姑娘们待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanging with the girls,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.47,1:34:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,做一下发型 手足护理\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting her hair done, mani-pedi.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.85,1:34:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们来了 而你们的妹妹没来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you come here without your sister…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.36,1:34:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能就要砍下你们的头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just might have to cut off your heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.74,1:34:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no, no. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.82,1:34:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 别 放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no. Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.12,1:34:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 所以我再问最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No. - So I'll ask one last time:
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.83,1:34:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在做手足护理 - 你们的妹妹在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Getting a mani-pedi! - Where is your sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.46,1:34:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.34,1:34:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温德琳·霍滕西亚·露维达·卡巴比克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwendolyn Hortencia Lewelda Kababik?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.68,1:34:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.22,1:34:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. That is me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.77,1:35:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有劳你 野蛮人老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, please, O Brutal One,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.23,1:35:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我的哥哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}release my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.19,1:35:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否愿意 在这一天这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is it your intention, on this day, at this hour,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:10.65,1:35:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,与扎特米尔的野蛮人尤尔根成婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}to wed Jurgen the Brutal of Zhatmire?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.24,1:35:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 正有此意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. That's my plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.54,1:35:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是否愿意为他延续血脉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And is it your intention to mother his children.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.20,1:35:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,使他与你的家族结为姻亲同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forge in blood this union with your family?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.58,1:35:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:26.63,1:35:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,格温德琳·卡巴比克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gwendolyn Kababik…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.71,1:35:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,举世闻名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Known throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.80,1:35:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,才貌双全\N{\fnArial\fs30}for your beauty and cunning.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.80,1:35:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.64,1:35:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以拿猎鹰宝石吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I hold the Falcon Jewel?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.23,1:35:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然可以 我的新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, my bride.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.40,1:35:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.24,1:35:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.28,1:35:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮人尤尔根\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jurgen the Brutal!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.03,1:36:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡巴比克兄弟行程延误仍在戈雷克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Brothers Kababik have been delayed in Gorek.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.71,1:36:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是假冒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are impostors!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.08,1:36:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 假冒的 - 抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Impostors? - Seize them!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.09,1:36:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我们可以解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. No. We can explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.00,1:36:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.05,1:36:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有件事我忘了告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot to tell you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.09,1:36:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.77,1:36:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back. Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.48,1:36:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,离远点 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away. Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.44,1:36:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.05,1:36:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.21,1:36:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你们给点了 混蛋们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will torch you, bitches.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.05,1:36:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你们的脸烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will literally burn your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.20,1:37:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去戈雷克见卡巴比克兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet the brothers in Gorek.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.49,1:37:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.29,1:37:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,去抓住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:27.62,1:37:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,去夺回宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get the jewel!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.92,1:37:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心我们 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about us. Just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.00,1:37:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,背包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:36.92,1:37:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,退远点 我会几何学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away! I know geometry.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:40.18,1:37:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是开玩笑 退远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not messing around, you guys. Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.18,1:37:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗里奇 我们要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fridge, we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.32,1:37:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁想跟新娘跳支舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody wanna dance with the bride?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.72,1:39:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想来一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a piece?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.27,1:39:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.06,1:39:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,双截棍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nunchucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.28,1:39:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.75,1:39:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.21,1:39:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.14,1:39:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on! - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.66,1:40:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.33,1:40:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是斯宾塞吗 - 我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that Spencer? - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.59,1:41:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.06,1:41:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.61,1:41:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.74,1:41:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斯摩德·布雷夫史东博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dr. Smolder Bravestone.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.79,1:41:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1\pos（294.769，1.636）}弱点\N勇敢岛浆果
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.10,1:41:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.52,1:42:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说骑到他背上 - 谁 我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He says to get on his back. - Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.68,1:42:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.68,1:42:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.69,1:42:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我天 - 他要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.02,1:42:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.40,1:42:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.78,1:42:55.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.95,1:42:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.91,1:43:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了 斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming, Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.46,1:43:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,「让其沐浴在阳光之下」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Show it to the sun."
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.38,1:43:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 宝石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa, the jewel!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.63,1:43:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得让它照到太阳 准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta show it to the sun! Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.27,1:43:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.89,1:43:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快飞 - 快点 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go! - Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.12,1:43:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.13,1:43:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大声呼喊其名 - 大声呼喊其名\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call out its name. - Call out its name.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.47,1:43:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,大声呼喊其名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call out its name!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.93,1:43:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumanji!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.89,1:44:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumanji!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.14,1:44:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd they say?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.27,1:44:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jumanji?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.59,1:44:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.34,1:44:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们胜利了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.76,1:44:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.43,1:44:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me down.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.85,1:44:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把我放下来 别闹了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Put me down, goddamn it. Stop! - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.73,1:44:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就是在找这个吗 这小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this what you were looking for? This little thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.31,1:44:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 你们真是太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa, you guys were incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.23,1:44:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 麦洛就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's the thing about Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.98,1:44:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有很多特长\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a lot of skills.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:54.03,1:44:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛和艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo and Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.70,1:44:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛和艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo and Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.83,1:45:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing here now?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.72,1:45:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 勇敢的冒险家们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, intrepid adventurers.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.68,1:45:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们又一次拯救了勇敢岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have saved Jumanji. Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.56,1:45:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在如果你同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, with your permission,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.98,1:45:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷夫史东博士 我就接管那宝石了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Bravestone, I will take the jewel from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.23,1:45:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用生命保护它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will protect it with my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.90,1:45:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它交还给埃维安省的长老保管\N{\fnArial\fs30}and return it to the care of the elder at the Avian Province.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.82,1:45:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在这里的工作就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so your work here is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:36.15,1:45:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,全勇敢岛感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of Jumanji thanks you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.11,1:45:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲伤的是 我们也要就此别过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, sadly, this is where we part.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.95,1:45:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道有什么好悲伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's sad about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.33,1:45:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经准备好赶快离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.71,1:45:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.79,1:45:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.05,1:45:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 你们不会相信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, you're not gonna believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.17,1:45:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.34,1:46:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他说他 - 想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He says that he… - He wants to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.51,1:46:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说总要有人留下守护这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says somebody's gotta stay and look after this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.64,1:46:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他都75岁了 刚学会飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that he's 75 years old and he just learned how to fly.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.90,1:46:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那样他就出不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he won't be able to get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.65,1:46:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.37,1:46:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.00,1:46:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得 我才刚和你重归于好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I, just got you back.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.08,1:46:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要永远失去你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm losing you for good.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.21,1:46:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,「你不会失去我的 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You're not losing me, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.13,1:46:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远在你身边「\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll always be with you."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.10,1:46:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being your partner…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.43,1:46:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我一辈子最好的事之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}is one of the best things I ever got to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.15,1:46:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说 「谢谢」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says, "Thank you."
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.36,1:46:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.15,1:46:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,该我说谢谢 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.60,1:47:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.22,1:47:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保重 麦洛 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take care, Milo! - Bye!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.35,1:47:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去吧 麦洛 - 再见 麦洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go, Milo! - So long, Milo!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.77,1:47:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 沃克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye, Mr. Walker!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.61,1:47:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是我的搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my partner right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.61,1:47:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有麦洛这样的朋友 那真是太幸运了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody should be so lucky to have a friend like Milo.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.84,1:48:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 外公 我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Grandpa. Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.18,1:48:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:16.11,1:48:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming to get me.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.99,1:48:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是再来 你就烂在这里好了 斯宾塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do it again, your ass is gonna be stuck here, Spencer!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.57,1:48:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不会再来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm not coming back!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.22,1:48:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.01,1:48:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.98,1:48:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:58.15,1:48:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.82,1:49:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.58,1:49:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,打 回到原位 反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strike. Square one. Counterstrike.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.00,1:49:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,下面那个大的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fat one on the bottom?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.04,1:49:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大的 不是 是R键上面那个大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fat… No, the fat one above the R.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:23.67,1:49:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 在二号上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Atop number two.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.80,1:49:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 打 打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah. So strike, strike.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.59,1:49:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 反击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Counterstrike.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.80,1:49:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后踢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then kick me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.77,1:49:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说点事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.06,1:49:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 变老 - 我知道 变老太不爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Getting old… - I know. Getting old sucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.19,1:49:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting old…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:47.74,1:49:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一份馈赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.62,1:49:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有时候会忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forget that sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.08,1:49:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.79,1:50:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人还能再要求什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What more could a guy possibly want?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.30,1:50:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.30,1:50:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今天过得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was your day?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.26,1:50:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was really great.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.85,1:50:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.56,1:50:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯宾塞教我玩了一个电子游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spencer taught me how to play a video game.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.56,1:50:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs18\b1\bord0\shad1}诺拉餐厅
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.20,1:50:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.26,1:50:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.55,1:50:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.01,1:50:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有很多美好的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of good memories here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.65,1:51:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.94,1:51:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪 是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.82,1:51:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.20,1:51:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:18.16,1:51:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up, bro?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.91,1:51:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,生意如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how's business?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.54,1:51:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.83,1:51:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的经理六个月前辞职了 搬去了费城\N{\fnArial\fs30}My manager quit six months ago, moved to Philly.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.75,1:51:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后这里就一直乱糟糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place has been kind of a mess ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.63,1:51:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难找到真正懂该如何运营餐馆的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to find people who really know how to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.72,1:51:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也不用我来跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.10,1:51:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么你这里需要帮忙咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you need some help around here?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:44.31,1:51:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.94,1:51:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.11,1:51:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be honored.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.20,1:51:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好 艾迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's really good to see you, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:56.16,1:51:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.63,1:52:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去把这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… I'm gonna take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:11.63,1:52:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到我要去的那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}where I was going and…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.01,1:52:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:16.51,1:52:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也得来纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys gotta come to New York too.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.97,1:52:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我等不及了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can't wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.48,1:52:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这支小队 永不走散\N{\fnArial\fs30}This team, forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.27,1:52:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不走散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.56,1:52:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:27.98,1:52:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直永不走散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always and forever?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.61,1:52:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要保持联系 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, let's keep close though. - Of course, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.61,1:52:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.32,1:52:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能都说好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we all agree?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.03,1:52:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也别回游戏里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's never go back there.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.70,1:52:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为我们早就说好了 - 肯定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought we already agreed on that. - That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.49,1:53:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉来这么晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry it's so late.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.08,1:53:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,每年到了这时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's that time of year.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.62,1:53:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家的暖气全坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's heaters are broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.92,1:53:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你来了就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's no problem. I'm just glad you made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.75,1:53:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,炉子就在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The furnace is right over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.80,1:53:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是旧的电子游戏机吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that an old video game console?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.05,1:53:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可能吧 是我儿子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, probably. It belongs to my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.06,1:53:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个游戏迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm a big gamer.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.60,1:53:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.69,1:53:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去是坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks like it's broken.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.16,1:54:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you shouldn't touch it.
